        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Show no mercy as you fling yourself into the wildest, wackiest cartoon racing games ever! But watch out! Fiendish opponents such as Dick Dastardly and Muttley will do anything to win.\n\nSo you'll need all your speed and wits to be first past the post!",
